    <string name="t_todas_as_mensagens_com_sao_apagadas">All messages with %1$s are permanently deleted from this phone, including those not yet sent. They cannot be recovered.\n\nThe contact stays and you can keep talking. Messages on the other person\'s phone are not deleted.</string>
    <string name="t_eliminar">Delete</string>
    <string name="t_apagar_contacto_2">Delete contact?</string>
    <string name="t_e_removido_da_tua_lista_e">%1$s is removed from your list and permanently deleted from this phone: the messages, those waiting to be sent and the keys of the encrypted conversation. This cannot be undone.\n\nIf you talk again, a new encrypted conversation starts. Messages on the other person\'s phone are not deleted.</string>
    <string name="t_destruir_perfil_e_dados_2">Destroy profile and data?</string>
    <string name="t_sao_apagados_para_sempre_do_servidor">Permanently deleted: from the server, your public keys and the messages waiting for you; from this phone, your ID and keys, all contacts, all conversations and settings. Your current ID stops working and you will have to create a new one.</string>
    <string name="t_sao_apagados_para_sempre_deste_telemovel">Permanently deleted from this phone: your ID and keys, all contacts, all conversations and settings. Your current ID stops working and you will have to create a new one. What is on the server deletes itself: waiting messages after 30 days and your public keys after 90 days.</string>
